$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (−)-(E,4R,7S,8S)-8-(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)-7,9-dimethyldeca-1,5-dien-4-ol
(20): A solution of enal 6 (6.00 g, 22.2 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (75 mL) was
cooled to –15 °C in a salt-ice bath and was added via cannula to a
separate RBF containing allyl silane [(S,S)- Leighton reagent] (28.6 g,
51.48 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (75 mL) at −15 °C. The reaction was then placed in
the freezer and allowed to react for 5 days. The reaction mixture was
then diluted with EtOAc (100 mL) and filtered through a plug of Celite to
remove the white precipitate that had formed after several minutes
stirring with EtOAc. The filtrate was then washed with sat. aq. NaHCO3
(75 mL) and brine (75 mL). The organics were then dried over Na2SO4.
After concentration the crude mixture was purified immediately by silica
gel column chromatography (5% EtOAc/Hexanes) to yield 5.80 g (84%) of
acetonide 20. The minor isomer (from the ca 10% enantiomer) was isolated
in a mixture with other products.
(−)-(E,4R,7S,8S)-8-(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)-7,9-dimethyldeca-1,5-dien-4-ol
(20):, yield 5.80 g (84%) Spectral data gave a satisfactory match to
previous reports.10 Rf = 0.60 (1:4 EtOAc:Hexanes), [α]25D = − 13 (c =
0.9, CH2Cl2); IR (neat, cm-1) 3345 (br), 2960, 2930, 2856, 1634, 1473,
1260, 1113, 1055, 1005, 975, 856, 775; 1H NMR (CDCl3, 600 MHz) δ 5.79 (m,
1H), 5.62 (dd, J = 15.0, 7.8 Hz, 1H), 5.44 (dd, J = 15.0, 7.2 Hz, 1H),
5.12 (m, 2H), 4.12 (m, 1H), 3.25 (dd, J = 6.0, 4.2 Hz, 1H), 2.30 (m, 3H),
1.73 (m, 1H), 1.56 (d, J = 4.0 Hz, 1H), 0.98 (d, J = 6.6 Hz, 3H), 0.89
(s, 9H), 0.87 (d, J = 6.7 Hz, 3H), 0.83 (d, J = 6.7 Hz, 3H), 0.03 (s,
6H); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 150 MHz) δ 136.1, 134.4, 131.1, 117.9, 80.9, 72.2,
42.0, 41.3, 31.5, 26.0, 20.5, 17.4, 16.7, -3.5, -3.8. HRMS (ESI) calcd
for [C18H36O2Si + Na]+: 335.2382 Found: 335.2385.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, (S,S)-Leighton reagent used
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Formal Total Synthesis of RK-397 via an Asymmetric Hydration and
Iterative Allylation Strategy
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Guo, Haibing; Mortensen, Matthew S.; O'Doherty, George A.
