$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Preparation of 1-(Furan-2-yl)-3-buten-1-ol (1l)6 Following the
Representative Procedure, 2-furaldehyde (96 mg, 1.0 mmol), RuCl3•xH2O
(6.2 mg, 0.03 mmol, 0.03 equiv), allyl acetate (130 μL, 1.2 mmol, 1.2
equiv), H2O (27 μL, 1.5 mmol, 1.5 equiv), Et3N (14 μL, 0.1 mmol, 0.1
equiv), hexamethylbenzene (16 mg, 0.1 mmol, internal standard for NMR
analysis) and dioxane (2.5 mL) were combined under 30 psi of CO at 70 °C
for 24 h. Workup and purification by silica gel column chromatography
eluting with hexanes/MTBE (10:1, 100 mL; 4:1, 200 mL); solvent was
removed in rotavap at 5-10 °C (25 torr) provided 1l (112 mg, 81%) as a
colorless oil. 1-(Furan-2-yl)-3-buten-1-ol (1l)6, yield 112 mg, 81%. Data
for 1l: 1H NMR: (500 MHz, CDCl3) 7.38 (dd, J = 2.0, 1.0, 1 H, HC(4')),
6.35 (d, J = 3.2, 2.0, 1 H, HC(3')), 6.23 (d, J = 3.5, 1.0, 1 H, HC(2')),
5.84-5.73 (m, 1 H, HC(3)), 5.20-5.09 (m, 2 H, H2C(4)), 4.72 (t, J = 6.5,
1 H, HC(1)), 2.65-2.55 (m, 2 H), 2.12 (br, 1 H, OH). 13C NMR: (125 MHz,
CDCl3) 155.9 (C(1')), 141.9 (C(4')), 133.6 (C(3)), 118.5 (C(4)), 110.1,
(C(2')), 106.0 (C(3')), 66.9 (C(1)), 40.0 (C(2)) IR: (NaCl) 3390 (s),
3075 (m), 2976 (m), 2913 (m), 1642 (m), 1506 (m), 1435 (m), 1228 (m),
1149 (s) HRMS: (CI) Calcd. for C8H11O2, 139.0759; found, 139.0760 TLC: Rf
0.27 (hexanes/MTBE, 4:1) [UV, CAM]
